body:
Thanks for #2757 (TASK-1944) and the BUG-2190 root cause. Next, before anything else: STORY-1853 slice S6, CI job fan-out (item 0 of the speed batch; it was added at the top of the brief, so you may have an older copy). Read the 2026-10-19 08:30 advisor comment on STORY-1853. Split .github/workflows/ci.yml 'build' into parallel jobs that share the rust-cache key:
(a) aida_cli_lib unit tests;
(b) and (c) aida-cli integration binaries in two deterministic halves;
(d) the remaining crates + doc tests;
(e) all non-test gates.
Then add an aggregate job named exactly 'Build (ubuntu-latest)' with needs: on all of them. Lose no tests: put the passed+ignored count vs a main run in the PR body. Target: PR CI in 12 min or less (today it is 35). Commit trailer (TASK-1949) (slice task; never (STORY-1853)). PR #2754 also touches ci.yml; if it lands first, merge it. After S6: finish BUG-2190, then wait for #2751 before items 3–5 (BUG-2187, BUG-2188+2168, TASK-1945, which is new: aida show TASK-1945).
